          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Choose the route before the product. If you are adding solar or want a system that runs itself, get installer quotes for the Tesla Powerwall 3, FranklinWH aPower 2 or, on an Enphase roof, the IQ Battery 5P. If you want to buy online and grow over time, the EcoFlow Delta Pro Ultra is the most capable plug-in system, with the Jackery Explorer 5000 Plus and Anker SOLIX F3800 Plus as strong 240V alternatives.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Whatever you buy, size the inverter for your largest simultaneous load, size the battery for the days you want to cover, and connect it to the house only through a transfer switch or approved backup panel installed by a licensed electrician.
